   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home Sweet Home Project/YUVA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After a devastating earthquake, according to WHO, the affected regions in Turkey and Syria are home to around 23 million people including 1.4 million children. Shelter has been critical area of intervention those who has lost their houses and businesses. With this project, we try to solve shelter problem with sustainable YUVA Project.  YUVA will be a solution shelter problem for families and also support local manufactures in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
